  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" width=\"119\" height=\"40\"></em></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em>1.21.4 и выше вы можете использовать ресурспак&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/theones-eating-animation-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Theone's Eating Animation Pack</a></em></strong></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Eating Animation — мод, добавляющий спрайтовые анимации для съедобных и питьевых предметов.</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Eating Animation — это клиентский мод!!!</strong></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Мод работает в одиночной игре:</strong></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pA3iI8d.gif\" width=\"1167\" height=\"778\"></em></strong></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>И в многопользовательской игре!:</strong></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lUafo7V.gif\" width=\"1173\" height=\"782\"></strong></em></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Для работы поддержки мода вам необходимо включить ресурспак</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>(ресурспак уже встроен в Minecraft)</strong></span><strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mkXq5GI.png\" width=\"509\" height=\"228\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>Список поддерживаемых модов:</strong></strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/food-pluss\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Food +</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/winterly\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Winterly</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Farmer's Delight</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Botania</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hybrid-aquatic\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Hybrid Aquatic</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-bumblezone-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">- The Bumblezone</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Additional Additions</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorn\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Adorn</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">- BetterEnd</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether\" rel=\"nofollow\">- BetterNether</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Create</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/duckling\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Duckling</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Expanded Delight</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/naturalist\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Naturalist</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snow-pig-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Snow Pig</a></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;Мои другие моды:</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minerally\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/847/834/638247404326048327.gif\" width=\"145\" height=\"145\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/food-pluss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/795/95/638154314085492278.gif\" width=\"145\" height=\"145\"></a></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/banilla-claws\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/877/103/638301712170926405.png\" width=\"145\" height=\"145\"></strong></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/DcemWeskeZ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ktDEUwS.png\"></a></strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">Как анимировать ваш ресурс-пак для мода Eating Animation!&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/theones-items-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Мой ресурс-пак поддерживает мод Eating Animation</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VB-fj2ITVYQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"295\" width=\"295\"></iframe></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Как анимировать данные пользовательских моделей —<br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0Ico2DYjiVY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"295\" width=\"295\"></iframe></span></strong></span><br><span style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QRjSa1h.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Порт Forge:</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Анимация еды [Forge]</a></p>